- name: fmod.soundgroup
  type: userdata
  desc: |
    A group of sounds. Controls limits on simultaneous playback and shared behavior.

    See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-soundgroup.html).
  notes: Must be released manually by calling release() when no longer needed.

  members:
  - name: release
    type: function
    desc: |
      Releases the soundgroup.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-soundgroup.html).
  - name: get_system_object
    type: function
    desc: |
