      Gets the max audible behavior of the soundgroup.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-soundgroup.html).
    returns:
    - name: behavior
      type: userdata
      desc: The behavior value


  - name: set_mute_fade_speed
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the mute fade speed of the soundgroup.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-soundgroup.html).
