- name: fmod.reverb3d
  type: userdata
  desc: |
    A 3D reverb zone that applies reverb to sounds within its sphere of influence.

    See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
  notes: Must be released manually by calling release() when no longer needed.

  members:
  - name: release
    type: function
    desc: |
      Releases the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
  - name: set_3d_attributes
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the 3 d attributes of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    parameters:
    - name: position
      type: vector3
      desc: Position value
    - name: mindistance
      type: number
      desc: Minimum distance for 3D attenuation
    - name: maxdistance
      type: number
      desc: Maximum distance for 3D attenuation
  - name: get_3d_attributes
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the 3 d attributes of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    returns:
    - name: position
      type: vector3
      desc: The position vector

    - name: mindistance
      type: userdata
      desc: The mindistance value

    - name: maxdistance
      type: userdata
      desc: The maxdistance value


  - name: set_properties
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the properties of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    parameters:
    - name: properties
      type: userdata
      desc: properties
  - name: get_properties
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the properties of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    returns:
    - name: properties
      type: fmod.reverb_properties
      desc: The properties


  - name: set_active
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the active of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    parameters:
    - name: active
      type: boolean
      desc: Bool value
  - name: get_active
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the active of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
    returns:
    - name: active
      type: userdata
      desc: The active value


  - name: set_user_data
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the user data of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
  - name: get_user_data
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the user data of the reverb 3 d.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-reverb3d.html).
- name: fmod.dsp
  type: userdata
  desc: |
    A DSP effect unit. Can be connected into the signal chain to process audio.

    See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/core-api-dsp.html).
  notes: Must be released manually by calling release() when no longer needed.

