- name: fmod.studio.eventinstance
  type: userdata
  desc: |
    A playing instance of a Studio event. Controls playback, parameters, and 3D attributes. Automatically garbage collected.

    See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-eventinstance.html).
  notes: Automatically garbage collected by Lua. No manual release needed.

  members:
  - name: is_valid
    type: function
    desc: |
      Returns whether the eventinstance is valid.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-eventinstance.html).
  - name: get_description
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the description of the eventinstance.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-eventinstance.html).
    returns:
    - name: description
      type: userdata
      desc: The description value


  - name: get_system
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the system of the eventinstance.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-eventinstance.html).
    returns:
    - name: system
      type: userdata
      desc: The system value


  - name: get_volume
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the volume of the eventinstance.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-eventinstance.html).
    returns:
    - name: volume
      type: userdata
      desc: The volume value

    - name: finalvolume
      type: userdata
