      Gets the length of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    returns:
    - name: length
      type: userdata
      desc: The length value


  - name: get_command_count
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the command count of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    returns:
    - name: count
      type: userdata
      desc: The count value


  - name: get_command_info
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the command info of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: commandindex
      type: number
      desc: Index value
    returns:
    - name: info
      type: fmod.studio.command_info
      desc: The info


  - name: get_command_string
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the command string of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: get_command_at_time
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the command at time of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: time
      type: number
      desc: time
    returns:
    - name: commandindex
      type: userdata
      desc: The commandindex value


  - name: set_bank_path
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the bank path of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: bankPath
      type: string
      desc: Bank handle
  - name: start
    type: function
    desc: |
      Starts the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: stop
    type: function
    desc: |
      Stops the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: seek_to_time
    type: function
    desc: |
      Seeks to to time in the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: time
      type: number
      desc: time
  - name: seek_to_command
    type: function
    desc: |
      Seeks to to command in the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: commandindex
      type: number
      desc: Index value
  - name: get_paused
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the paused of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    returns:
    - name: paused
      type: userdata
      desc: The paused value


  - name: set_paused
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the paused of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    parameters:
    - name: paused
      type: boolean
      desc: Paused state
  - name: get_playback_state
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the playback state of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    returns:
    - name: state
      type: userdata
      desc: The state value


  - name: get_current_command
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the current command of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
    returns:
    - name: commandindex
      type: userdata
      desc: The commandindex value

    - name: currenttime
      type: userdata
      desc: The currenttime value


  - name: release
    type: function
    desc: |
      Releases the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: set_frame_callback
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the frame callback of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: set_load_bank_callback
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the load bank callback of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: set_create_instance_callback
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the create instance callback of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: get_user_data
    type: function
    desc: |
      Gets the user data of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).
  - name: set_user_data
    type: function
    desc: |
      Sets the user data of the commandreplay.

      See [FMOD docs](https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.03/api/studio-api-commandreplay.html).

